senses.gloss:
परि-√ 3. कल् P. -कलयति, to seize, take hold of Bālar. ix, 18;
to swallow, devour, Kād.; Hcar.;
to observe, consider as, Śiś. viii, 9.

परि-√ कृष् P. Ā. -कर्षति, ˚ते, to draw or drag about (Ā.. also ‘each other’), MBh.;
to lead (an army), R.;
to rule, govern, be master of (acc.), MBh.;
to harass, afflict, ib.;
to ponder, reflect constantly upon (acc.), ib.;
 (P. -कृषति) to draw or make furrows, to plough, ŚBr.; KātyŚr.;
to draw a circle, Śulbas. :
Caus. -कर्षयति, to drag to and fro, torment, harass, vex, trouble, R.; BhP. ;
to carry (as a nurse), Divyāv.

परि-√ कॢप् Caus. -कल्पयति (Pass. -कल्प्यते), to fix, settle, determine, destine for (with acc., अर्थम् ifc., loc. or an inf. with pass. sense), Mn.; MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to choose, VarBṛS. lix, 11;
to perform, execute, accomplish, contrive, arrange, make, Yājñ.; Ragh.; Kathās.;
to distribute, divide (with an adv. in धा), Mn.; Var.; MBh.;
to admit or invite to (loc.), MBh.;
to suppose, presuppose, Sarvad.

परि-√ क्रम् P. -क्रामति or -क्रमति (rarely Ā. ˚ते; p. -क्रामत् or -क्रमत्; pf. -चक्राम, -चक्रमुर्; aor. -अक्रमीत्; inf. -क्रान्तुम्; ind.p. -क्रा॑मम्, or -क्रम्य),
to step or walk round or about, circumambulate, roam over, walk through, visit (with acc.), RV. &c. &c.;
to go past, escape, AitBr.;
to outstrip, overtake, R. :
Intens. -चङ्क्रमति, to move or walk about perpetually, BhP.

परि-√ क्री Ā. -क्रीणीते (Pāṇ. i, 3, 18; really more frequent in P., e.g. impf. -अक्रीणम्, AV.; Pot. -क्रीणीयात्, ŚāṅkhŚr.; ind.p. -क्रीय, Gobh.),
to purchase, buy, barter, gain, acquire, AV.; ŚBr.; Lāṭy.; Gobh. (with instr. or dat. of the price, e.g. शतेन, or शताय, to buy for a hundred, Pāṇ. i, 4, 44);
to hire, engage for stipulated wages, ŚBr.; ŚrS.;
to recompense, reward (only p. Ā. -क्रीणान), Bhaṭṭ.

परि-√ क्षिप् P. -क्षिपति (pf. -चिक्षेप; ind.p. -क्षिप्य),
to throw over or beyond, R.;
to put or lay or wind round, Suśr.;
to throw about, surround, encircle, embrace, ib.; MBh.; R. &c.;
to throw or put or fix in (loc.), MBh.;
to throw away, squander (as a treasure), Kathās.
